    "body": "## Summary\n\n- add `DecryptResult` with plaintext and optional replacement ciphertext\n- keep raw decrypt return values backward compatible\n- export the result from `langgraph_sdk`\n\n## Merge order\n\nIndependent of langgraph-api#3884. Merge and release this SDK change before LSD-1489 consumes the result in langgraph-api.\n\n## Test plan\n\n- `make format`\n- `make lint`\n- `make test`",
